# I&A + Mike's UI

**Library:** `F:\Mikes-UI-Exp` (production GUID `B3F91C6A4E275D08`). This repo depends on it. Prefix `IA_` here, `MUI_` there. Never edit GameSources. Read `F:\Mikes-UI-Exp\README.md` and the Consumer headers on MUI classes.

Enforce: no ternary. Every `new` in a `ref`. Colors `Color.FromSRGBA`. Paint `DrawX/Y` + `GetDrawOpacity()`.

## Where UI lives

- `IA_AdminConfigMenu` / `IA_StatisticsMenu` — `MUI_MenuBase`. Override `BuildUI`. Mount failure → `OnMUIMountFailed` → legacy layout.
- `IA_NotificationDisplay` — `MUI_HudHost` + `MakePassThroughOverlay`. Tick from `DisplayUpdate`. No `MenuWithEditorContext`.
- Uplink kit (`Scripts/Game/UI`) — `IA_UplinkFrame`, `IA_UplinkTabs`, `IA_UplinkButton/Toggle/Field/Choice/Slider/Meter/Scroll/Caption/Note/Pair`. Each has static `Create(runtime, ...)` that adopts and names the node. Tabs, Choice and Caption are plain `MUI_Node`s; the rest subclass the MUI control (`MUI_Button`, `MUI_Toggle`, `MUI_NumericField`, …), so the menu keeps `MUI_*` member types. Colours and shared shapes come from `IA_UplinkStyle.Get()` (not a node). `IA_UplinkPair` puts two controls in a row and carries gamepad up/down across both columns.
- `IA_LeaderboardBoard` — paints the whole table from `IA_BoardModel` through two helper children (`IA_BoardViewport`, `IA_BoardRowsLayer`). No per-row nodes.
- Hint overlays (admin menu only) — `CreateHintLayer`, last child of the overlay, `AddHint` per control. Help calls `Toggle()`. Copy stays in I&A.
- Pause menu stays vanilla.

Do **not** resurrect `IA_MikesMenuHost`. Do **not** add I&A screens inside Mikes-UI.

## Build pattern

Overlay (`MakeOverlay`, fill 0) → `CreateFxBackdrop` → `IA_UplinkFrame.Create` → children; a hint layer, when the menu has one, last child of the overlay. Store every kept control as `protected ref MUI_*`. Lists: `SetViewportHeight`. Buttons in a row: Hug + Grow 1, never Fill width. Custom I&A nodes: `runtime.Adopt` + `AddChild`.

If the compositor is wrong, patch `F:\Mikes-UI-Exp`, not a copy here.
